WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.832 --> 00:00:08.712
In this video you'll suggest where Fixer Nation lessons and games fit your standards, and then send your framework to us for review.

2
00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:15.236
On any standard, choose a lesson, a brain game, or our program as a whole from the list.

3
00:00:15.737 --> 00:00:26.217
Then add a short note about why you think it fits. Your note stays private, and it's only seen by our team. We write the public explanation ourselves, so you don't have to.

4
00:00:26.718 --> 00:00:31.718
Select Suggest connection. It appears under the standard, marked Suggested.

5
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.450
Here, we'll suggest the program as a whole for the second standard.

6
00:00:36.951 --> 00:00:41.731
Changed your mind? Select Remove suggestion on a connection you added.

7
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:53.933
When you're ready, scroll to the submit area. You'll need to tick the box that says this is your district's official framework, and that you're authorized to submit it. You also need at least one standard in it.

8
00:00:54.435 --> 00:01:00.245
Select Submit for review. The status changes to In review, and our team is notified.

9
00:01:00.746 --> 00:01:10.356
Our team compares your standards with your official link, confirms who you are, writes the explanation for each suggested connection, and then publishes.

10
00:01:10.858 --> 00:01:17.248
If you spot a mistake after submitting, select Take back to draft, fix it, and submit again.
